{"id":"d8f73bfff82094412060126261c70172e8fabda6","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1259519","title":"Ai 时代，还想掌握代码是痴心妄想吗？","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"6581","excerpt":"程序员 - @6581 - 同志们，AI 时代带来了效率的巨大提升！这个时候，还妄想掌握代码细节，是痴心妄想吗？","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div>\n    \n    <div><p><a href=\"/member/6581\"><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/cc1d/9600/656439_xlarge.png?m=1794361777\" width=\"73\" alt=\"6581\" data-uid=\"656439\"></a></p>\n    \n    \n    \n     &#160; <p><small><a href=\"/member/6581\">6581</a> · <span title=\"2026-11-24 17:54:46 +08:00\">1 day ago</span> · 1567 views</small>\n    </p></div>\n    \n    \n    \n    <div><p>同志们，AI 时代带来了效率的巨大提升！<br>\n这个时候，还妄想掌握代码细节，是痴心妄想吗？</p></div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n</div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n<div id=\"topic-replies\">\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/AI\"><li></li> AI</a><a href=\"/tag/代码\"><li></li> 代码</a><a href=\"/tag/效率\"><li></li> 效率</a></P><p><span>16 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-11-25 16:54:46 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18323443\" data-reply-id=\"18323443\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/1ff2/d671/473138_normal.png?m=1678938049\" alt=\"Explr\" data-uid=\"473138\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            <div><p><strong><a href=\"/member/Explr\">Explr</a></strong></p><p><span title=\"2026-11-24 18:11:07 +08:00\">23h 47m ago via Android</span></p></div>\n            <p><span>1</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <div><p>我感觉不太行，人工检查代码的速度跟不上 AI 生成的速度。如果硬要掌握细节的话，估计会拖慢 AI 的速度吧。但是人工检查测试和测试用例应该还是可以的。</p></div>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18323463\" data-reply-id=\"18323463\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/143726892bcb430af66d04d3398e0ecd?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"unused\" data-uid=\"743959\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>2</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <div><p>未来不需要，但现在是人掌控不了但 AI 可靠性不够的尴尬阶段。</p></div>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18323470\" data-reply-id=\"18323470\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/6fb7/882c/72419_normal.png?m=1792027235\" alt=\"archxm\" data-uid=\"72419\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>3</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <div><p>为了掌握代码而掌握代码？</p></div>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18323477\" data-reply-id=\"18323477\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/536c/e051/510179_normal.png?m=1788579475\" alt=\"jenhe\" data-uid=\"510179\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>4</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <div><p>不需要那么多的 AI 监工，大多数程序员该去哪？</p></div>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18323483\" data-reply-id=\"18323483\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0515/645c/264467_normal.png?m=1730183207\" alt=\"chendy\" data-uid=\"264467\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>6</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <div><p>有 AI 之前就是<br>\n有 AI 只有也是</p>\n<p>但是其实有 AI 之后简单了很多</p>\n</div>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18324050\" data-reply-id=\"18324050\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/610d06995a2af0fabedb935a420b532b?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"dwhh\" data-uid=\"579717\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>7</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <div><p>不知道为什么要在这样的地方浪费时间，想掌握代码就去看，虽然很大概率不可能，但是怎么可能连 diff 都看不懂呢？<br>\n另外，很显然未来才是该担心的。</p></div>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    \n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18324649\" data-reply-id=\"18324649\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/95e3/37c4/549405_normal.png?m=1758532367\" alt=\"c0nstantien\" data-uid=\"549405\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>9</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <div><p>周末逛零食店看到琳琅满目的零食我在想，这些用工业机器生产出来的零食和现在用大模型跑出来的代码产品本质是一样的，可能若干年后就会出现什么以纯手工打造为卖点的软件产品了</p></div>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    \n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18324914\" data-reply-id=\"18324914\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3d81/6534/671317_normal.png?m=1795583784\" alt=\"fakEHacker\" data-uid=\"671317\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>11</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <div><p>不是吧，我感觉你起码得能看懂，懂原理。<br>\n理论上你的天花板取决于你能参与的颗粒度</p>\n<p>参与粗 那就不是专业的<br>\n参与细 那肯定天花板要比普通人要高</p>\n<p>PS：我现在还在学 WINDOWS32 汇编呢😭</p>\n</div>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18325155\" data-reply-id=\"18325155\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/a3314cfe477d8563e07b50384c52993f?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"phatzhong24\" data-uid=\"491412\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>12</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <div><p>自己的项目, 你一点代码细节都可以不用了解,有功能直接让 AI 加,有 bug 直接让 AI 改.</p>\n<p>公司项目你试试? 你也不敢,因为大概率出问题,频繁出问题,最坏的结果就是打包走人,衡量完就不会这么干</p>\n</div>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18325472\" data-reply-id=\"18325472\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/dd61/58ab/345481_normal.png?m=1795524874\" alt=\"leaflxh\" data-uid=\"345481\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>13</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <div><p>从写汇编一下跳到写自然语言确实有点不太适应，主要是不会做测试，怕代码崩了</p></div>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18326232\" data-reply-id=\"18326232\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/5c6305a99335f422fdc5153c16511ec0?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"zqguo\" data-uid=\"313188\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>14</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <div><p>掌握到 60 分就行了</p></div>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    \n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18326784\" data-reply-id=\"18326784\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/ede7/8258/20871_normal.png?m=1795454362\" alt=\"blackmao\" data-uid=\"20871\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>16</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <div><p>再厉害的程序员也干不过 AI， 程序员本身就是工具人，被 AI 工具替代了</p></div>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n    \n    \n\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n            </div></DIV>","content_text":"6581 · 1 day ago · 1567 views 同志们，AI 时代带来了效率的巨大提升！ 这个时候，还妄想掌握代码细节，是痴心妄想吗？ AI 代码 效率16 replies • 2026-11-25 16:54:46 +08:00 Explr23h 47m ago via Android 1 我感觉不太行，人工检查代码的速度跟不上 